{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stranded on a strange island where ancient hostile forces lurk in the shadows, you must survive, explore... and find your way home.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scavenge for water, food, shelter. Battle disease, exhaustion, and despair.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forage, mine, fish, cook\u2014but also fight. Craft equipment to gain unique Power Dice (wood/silver/gold), swaying your fate in critical moments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key actions\u2014especially combat\u2014are resolved through dice rolls. Forge gear tailored to each challenge, and outmaneuver dangers in a living world ruled by day/night cycles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What secrets does this island hold? What are you truly fleeing? And how far will you go to survive?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Struggle to survive in a hostile environment and find a way back to civilization.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the island and gather resources to meet vital needs while avoiding disease, exhaustion, or despair.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your camp to improve rest, healing, and survival conditions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft equipment to obtain Power Dice (Wood/Silver/Gold) suited for every challenge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover secrets of an island both beautiful and eerie, shaped by day-night cycles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reveal the truth behind your arrival, the hero\u2019s intentions, and the shadows of their past.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face enemies in turn-based combat where strategy and dice decide your fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Dice or Die</i> offers unique tabletop-inspired gameplay.<br>Most critical actions are resolved by dice rolls, adding uncertainty to your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Acquire these Power Dice through equipment\u2014crafted in wood, silver, or gold tiers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"c0e8c33ff9866a7af6f5f12557a704921663f50b.jpg","localized_name":"The First Fire","name":"The First Fire","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1278860/c0e8c33ff9866a7af6f5f12557a704921663f50b.jpg"},{"icon":"98b35e330c0c28eaa40f80440980d838dfac4ea3.jpg","localized_name":"Hebe's Awakening","name":"Hebe's Awakening","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1278860/98b35e330c0c28eaa40f80440980d838dfac4ea3.jpg"},{"icon":"af8f727c3f18e1e0824f404b3e05343dc9218a16.jpg","localized_name":"Kheran's Shadow","name":"Kheran's Shadow","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1278860/af8f727c3f18e1e0824f404b3e05343dc9218a16.jpg"},{"icon":"4646cf9a9e90246f4efd952792a3e53ddceda2fc.jpg","localized_name":"The Unchained Breath","name":"The Unchained Breath","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1278860/4646cf9a9e90246f4efd952792a3e53ddceda2fc.jpg"},{"icon":"c042ba93534fc64d696138705c9df2822bff981b.jpg","localized_name":"The Horizon's Call","name":"The Horizon's Call","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1278860/c042ba93534fc64d696138705c9df2822bff981b.jpg"},{"icon":"e242c66e674914546891a55faff998c993c95dac.jpg","localized_name":"The Sealed Earth","name":"The Sealed Earth","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1278860/e242c66e674914546891a55faff998c993c95dac.jpg"},{"icon":"858d5a444514ba721666720d68d7ec3b6e1290f4.jpg","localized_name":"The Abyssal Worm","name":"The Abyssal Worm","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1278860/858d5a444514ba721666720d68d7ec3b6e1290f4.jpg"}],"total":7},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepageback